config USB_DISPLAY_WAKE
    bool "Keep the display on while USB powered"
    depends on ZMK_DISPLAY
    default n
    help
      When enabled, the display will not blank due to the normal
      inactivity idle timeout as long as the keyboard has USB power
      present (whether plugged into a computer, a charger, or a
      power bank). This only bypasses the idle-blanking check for
      the display; keystrokes and everything else are unaffected
      and continue to route over whichever transport (USB or
      Bluetooth) is selected as normal.
